      - {x: 0.91, y: 0.56}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
  - title: 04 / Test the fault latch
    explanation: Both faults cut the heater, run the fan, and light the fault LED.
      Restore the sensor after each fault and watch the warning stay on. RESET FAULT
      is available after a valid cool reading returns. Finish both tests and verify
      normal outputs.
    caption: "OPEN \u2248 5 V  \u2022  SHORT \u2248 0 V"
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.56}
      label: BATTERY +
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
    - id: pullup
      kind: 1
      position: {x: 0.31, y: 0.56}
      label: "10 k\u03A9 PULL-UP"
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: sense
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.5, y: 0.71}
      label: "SENSE \u2192 FAULT"
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: ntc
      kind: 1
      position: {x: 0.69, y: 0.56}
      label: "NTC \xB7 OPEN / SHORT"
      color: {r: 0.24, g: 0.87, b: 0.8, a: 1}
    - id: negative
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.91, y: 0.56}
      label: "BATTERY \u2212"
